msgstr "Procijenjena jačina"

msgid ""
"Everything in the vault is encrypted again with the new password. Backups "
"made earlier still open with the password they were made with."
msgstr ""
"Sve u trezoru ponovno se šifrira novom lozinkom. Ranije izrađene sigurnosne "
"kopije i dalje se otvaraju lozinkom kojom su izrađene."

msgid "Everything is in sync"
msgstr "Sve je usklađeno"

msgid ""
"Everything returns to how it was when the copy was made, including "
"attachments and password history. Entries created later disappear. The "
"current vault is kept in a file next to it."
msgstr ""
"Sve se vraća na stanje u trenutku izrade kopije, uključujući privitke i "
"povijest lozinki. Kasnije stvoreni unosi nestaju. Trenutni trezor čuva se u "
"datoteci pokraj njega."

msgid "Everything was already in sync"
msgstr "Sve je već bilo sinkronizirano"

msgid "Export complete"
msgstr "Izvoz dovršen"

msgid "Export failed"
msgstr "Izvoz nije uspio"

msgid "Export to KeePass"
