msgid ""
"Folders organize your passwords. You can choose them when adding or editing."
msgstr ""
"Mape organiziraju vaše lozinke. Možete ih odabrati pri dodavanju ili "
"uređivanju."

msgid "Follow the system"
msgstr "Prati sustav"

msgid ""
"For Nextcloud, the base URL looks like https://cloud.example.com/remote.php/"
"dav/files/USERNAME"
